<div class="mandarin-hanzi">饭店</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">fàndiàn</div>

''Meaning:'' restaurant; hotel (regional/contextual senses)  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
这家饭店晚上开门。 — Zhè jiā fàndiàn wǎnshang kāimén. — This restaurant opens in the evening.

!! Usage note
In Mainland usage often ‘restaurant’; in some contexts/regions it can mean ‘hotel’. Verify local usage in final gloss.
